SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:02:08 and reappears at 17:56:09 IST\, se
 en from Dwarka.\nThe Moon is 42° up in the SW · daylight\, Sun +26°.\nT
 imes against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon'
 s edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Dwarka
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Dwarka
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
